This license applies to the source code, compiled builds and assets of this project
(the "Software"). You are free to use the Software, change it and build on top of it.
The one thing it is not for is taking its code apart and reusing it in other projects.

1. Definitions

   "You" means any person or organization exercising rights under this license.

   "Other Project" means any software, mod, plugin, library, tool or service that is not
   the Software itself or a modified version of it, whether it is free or paid, public
   or private, open or closed source, and whatever its size.

2. What you may do

   a. View and study. You may read the source code and learn from it.

   b. Use. You may run the Software, official or modified, for any purpose, including on
      public, private and monetized servers.

   c. Use in your projects. You may use the Software as part of your own projects, such
      as servers, modpacks, maps, videos and streams, and you may build Other Projects
      that work alongside the Software or depend on it.

   d. Modify. You may change the Software, build it and use your modified version
      yourself, on your servers and in your community.

   e. Share modified source. You may publish your modified source code, for example as a
      public fork, as long as it keeps this license, keeps the credit to FalatiaProject
      and clearly states that it is modified.

   f. Contribute. You may propose changes back to this project. By submitting a
      contribution, you agree that FalatiaProject may use, change and distribute it under
      this license or any other terms.

   g. Share the official release. You may include unmodified official builds of the
      Software in modpacks, server packs and similar collections, provided that you do
      not charge for the Software itself and you credit FalatiaProject with a link to
      the official project page.

   h. Make content. Emotes, animations, icons and other content you create for use with
      the Software belong to you. This license places no restrictions on them.

3. What you may not do

   a. Copy any part of the Software into an Other Project. This covers source code,
      classes, methods, algorithms as written here, shaders, assets and data formats as
      implemented here, in whole or in part, copied directly, rewritten line by line,
      translated into another programming language or otherwise adapted from this code.

   b. Upload the Software or a modified build of it to download sites or mod hosting
      platforms as your own project, except as allowed in section 2(g).

   c. Sell the Software or a modified version of it, or charge for access to it.

   d. Remove or change copyright notices, this license or the credit to FalatiaProject.

   e. Use the names "Falatia" or "FalatiaProject", or the project's logos, in a way that
      suggests your work is official or endorsed, without written permission.

4. Compatibility

   Writing an independent, compatible implementation that works with the Software,
   such as a server, a client or a tool that reads or writes the same files, is
   allowed, provided that it does not reuse any part of the Software as described in
   section 3(a).

5. Third-party components

   Parts of this repository may be covered by their own licenses. Those licenses apply
   to those parts instead of this one. In particular, the Blender add-on in
   tools/blender is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later.

6. Other permissions

   If you want to do something this license does not allow, ask FalatiaProject. Any
   additional permission must be given in writing.

7. Termination

   If you break the terms of this license, your rights under it end automatically.
   They are restored if you fix the breach within 30 days of being notified, unless you
   have broken the terms before.

